# Do not auto-open the browser

Never open the browser, Chrome DevTools, or a live preview on your own after making changes the user asked for.

- Do not navigate, screenshot, or click through the app unless the user explicitly asks to verify in the browser.
- Prefer tests, code review, and describing what changed. Mention that browser verification was skipped because of this preference.
- If the user later asks to check the UI, then use browser tools for that request only.
